cess from child module\n   - Used `split_at_mut` pattern for `frames_length_data_encode` to avoid double-mutable-borrow\n   - Handled cross-platform AF_INET6 differences with `#[cfg(target_os = \"macos\")]`\n   - Used `Box::leak` for solution_dir to satisfy `Option<&'static str>` return type\n\n6. All user messages:\n   - \"# Phase 4 batch translation: 5 source files\\n\\nFill in `todo!()` function bodies in the Rust files listed below...\" [The full Phase 4 batch translation prompt containing: required reading instructions, list of 5 source files with todo counts, translation rules (faithful/idiomatic, no unsafe, no signature changes, no new public items, tests are the gate), verification commands, and process instructions (read guide once, then per-file: read Rust target, find C source, translate, check)]\n\n7. Pending Tasks:\n   - Complete remaining todo!() bodies in `rs/fq/src/utils.rs` (~24 remaining: set_solution_dir, solution_dir, get_input_path, file_delete, all frames_* functions, constant_time_memcmp, uint8_to_str)\n   - Translate all 42 todo!() bodies in `rs/fq/src/tls_api.rs`\n   - Translate all 16 todo!() bodies in `rs/fq/src/packet_loop.rs`\n   - Fix doc-comment false positives in hash.rs and splay.rs (update stale \"bodies are todo!()\" text)\n   - Run final gate: `python3 scripts/phase4_check.py` on all 5 files, `cargo fmt`, `cargo test --no-run`, `cargo clippy --tests --all-features -- -D warnings`\n\n8. Current Work:\n   Immediately before this summary, the assistant was editing `rs/fq/src/utils.rs` using sequential `Edit` tool calls to fill in `todo!()` function bodies. The last successful edit replaced the entire block of address helper functions from `compare_addr` through `set_preferred_address`. The file has been partially updated with ~32 of 56 todo!()s resolved. The remaining todo!()s in utils.rs are the solution-dir helpers, file_delete, all frames encode/decode functions, constant_time_memcmp, and uint8_to_str.\n\n   The last edit replaced